    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Could you go a bit deeper into the melanoidins? I want to understand how their molecular weight and structure change as the reaction progresses, especially in terms of how they contribute to the visual pigment of the crust. Also, is there any chance that certain protein structures might actually resist these transformations even in alkaline environments?",
